00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:14,740
( Watch on Kissasia.vip )

1
00:01:36,945 --> 00:01:40,098
[Episode 2]

2
00:02:10,885 --> 00:02:12,285
You should leave now.

3
00:02:12,285 --> 00:02:13,885
Run far away.

4
00:02:14,652 --> 00:02:18,365
The people from Hanshui Palace
weren't badly hurt.

5
00:02:18,365 --> 00:02:20,605
They might come back for you.

6
00:02:21,518 --> 00:02:23,051
I can't guarantee to protect you.

7
00:02:23,051 --> 00:02:26,225
If you stay with me, you won't be safe.

8
00:02:27,252 --> 00:02:30,345
When did Yan Zi Qing become so useless?

9
00:02:31,918 --> 00:02:33,485
You're hurt?

10
00:02:34,485 --> 00:02:36,485
I blame myself for being too weak.

11
00:02:36,485 --> 00:02:37,652
Let me help.

12
00:02:38,652 --> 00:02:41,085
Are the Hanshui Palace people that powerful?

13
00:02:42,085 --> 00:02:44,785
I've kept them here for you.

14
00:02:45,518 --> 00:02:47,918
Come here,
you didn't drink that poison, did you?

15
00:02:48,718 --> 00:02:50,018
That's a relief.

16
00:02:51,118 --> 00:02:52,485
It's getting dark.

17
00:02:52,485 --> 00:02:54,352
Get him down the mountain quickly.

18
00:02:54,352 --> 00:02:55,625
What about you?

19
00:02:56,485 --> 00:02:58,918
Have you forgotten? We're not on the same path.

20
00:02:58,918 --> 00:03:01,085
But we just agreed that we're even.

21
00:03:01,085 --> 00:03:02,465
I helped you lose Yan Zi Qing.

22
00:03:02,465 --> 00:03:04,718
You drove off Hanshui Palace for me
and saved the child.

23
00:03:04,718 --> 00:03:07,125
Actually, I'm the one who owes you a favor.

24
00:03:08,518 --> 00:03:12,885
Does Linglong Manor always calculate favors
in such a unique way?

25
00:03:12,885 --> 00:03:15,785
Anyway, I don't like owing people.

26
00:03:18,752 --> 00:03:20,352
They're coming from the east.

27
00:03:20,352 --> 00:03:22,145
Let's head down the mountain and hide first.

28
00:03:22,145 --> 00:03:23,525
What if we run into them on the way?

29
00:03:23,525 --> 00:03:26,565
The drums mean they make the pursuers
head up from the east.

30
00:03:26,565 --> 00:03:28,352
Then we'll head down from the west.

31
00:03:28,352 --> 00:03:29,858
You can understand drums?

32
00:03:29,858 --> 00:03:32,765
The training routines of government troops
are all quite similar.

33
00:03:32,765 --> 00:03:34,937
I only know some basics.

34
00:03:34,937 --> 00:03:37,424
Did you offend the government, too?

35
00:03:43,925 --> 00:03:45,445
We won't make it off the mountain before dark.

36
00:03:45,445 --> 00:03:46,805
Let's find a place to hide first.

37
00:03:46,805 --> 00:03:48,864
Let's go.

38
00:04:15,352 --> 00:04:17,551
What is this being worshipped here?

39
00:04:17,551 --> 00:04:19,318
It's quite terrifying.

40
00:04:22,085 --> 00:04:23,718
It's a Yaksha.

41
00:04:28,418 --> 00:04:30,952
There was one behind the counter
at the inn as well.

42
00:04:31,551 --> 00:04:32,818
How strange.

43
00:04:32,818 --> 00:04:34,418
Why would anyone worship a demon?

44
00:04:34,418 --> 00:04:38,252
In this Xiangzhou area,
many people worship the Yaksha.

45
00:04:40,218 --> 00:04:42,418
It must be a local custom.

46
00:04:47,685 --> 00:04:49,885
Linglong Manor is in Xiangzhou.

47
00:04:49,885 --> 00:04:51,701
Haven't you seen this before, Huo?

48
00:04:51,701 --> 00:04:53,245
I usually stay inside the manor.

49
00:04:53,245 --> 00:04:55,865
I know very little of the world outside.

50
00:04:58,965 --> 00:05:00,285
No wonder.

51
00:05:00,285 --> 00:05:03,065
The innkeeper said I looked like an outsider.

52
00:05:55,805 --> 00:05:59,205
Is your back wound really alright?

53
00:05:59,205 --> 00:06:00,699
I'm fine.

54
00:06:00,699 --> 00:06:03,254
It's just a flesh wound.

55
00:06:12,805 --> 00:06:15,437
This is our Linglong Manor's
secret Linglong Honey.

56
00:06:15,437 --> 00:06:18,203
It stops bleeding and eases pain.

57
00:06:18,203 --> 00:06:20,348
Thank you, Huo.

58
00:06:32,645 --> 00:06:33,695
So, tell me.

59
00:06:33,695 --> 00:06:36,884
How did you cross paths with
Yan Zi Qing and his lot?

60
00:06:37,685 --> 00:06:39,565
Just some grievance.

61
00:06:39,565 --> 00:06:41,529
It's nothing major.

62
00:06:42,529 --> 00:06:47,146
Actually, Linglong Manor and Yunying Sect
have a bit of a history together.

63
00:06:47,146 --> 00:06:48,885
Why don't you tell me the details?

64
00:06:48,885 --> 00:06:51,948
Let me see if I can help smooth things over.

65
00:06:55,892 --> 00:06:57,605
What are you laughing at?

66
00:06:57,605 --> 00:07:00,225
Do you think I can't handle it?

67
00:07:01,525 --> 00:07:05,885
I simply don't think
you can return to your manor.

68
00:07:05,885 --> 00:07:07,251
What do you mean?

69
00:07:07,251 --> 00:07:11,485
You said, "No one dares to provoke
Linglong Manor in Xiangzhou."

70
00:07:11,485 --> 00:07:15,551
Yet you'd rather flee with a child
than go back home for help.

71
00:07:15,551 --> 00:07:19,430
Isn't it because you caused trouble
and can't go back anymore?

72
00:07:19,430 --> 00:07:21,777
Who says I can't go back?

73
00:07:21,777 --> 00:07:24,565
I just don't want to.

74
00:07:25,565 --> 00:07:28,652
The Yin Yang An is the treasure
of Linglong Manor.

75
00:07:28,652 --> 00:07:32,361
It is said that it stays in the Huo family hall
and has never left.

76
00:07:32,361 --> 00:07:35,005
Now, this sword is in your hands.

77
00:07:35,005 --> 00:07:37,818
And you don't even have anyone to protect you.

78
00:07:37,818 --> 00:07:39,885
I assume when you left the manor,

79
00:07:39,885 --> 00:07:43,225
Master Huo wasn't aware of it, right?

80
00:07:48,051 --> 00:07:51,051
Fine. You guessed it.

81
00:07:51,051 --> 00:07:53,485
But I didn't cause any trouble.

82
00:07:53,485 --> 00:07:57,785
I just ruined the marriage between
the Huo family and Shao Ji Zu.

83
00:07:57,785 --> 00:07:59,318
Why did you do that?

84
00:07:59,318 --> 00:08:02,765
Because our young mistress won't marry
someone she doesn't like.

85
00:08:04,885 --> 00:08:07,952
Everyone says, "Shao Ji Zu is quite good."

86
00:08:07,952 --> 00:08:09,445
But so what if he's good?

87
00:08:09,445 --> 00:08:11,252
Does she have to marry him for that?

88
00:08:12,018 --> 00:08:13,485
Speaking of being good,

89
00:08:13,485 --> 00:08:15,218
our young mistress is good too.

90
00:08:15,218 --> 00:08:17,485
She's been educated in arts and martial arts.

91
00:08:18,685 --> 00:08:24,068
It's just that she has never seen the world
outside of Linglong Manor.

92
00:08:26,652 --> 00:08:29,018
Even if she is to marry,

93
00:08:29,018 --> 00:08:32,965
she must first go out and see the world
and gain some experience.

94
00:08:32,965 --> 00:08:36,748
Then she can judge for herself
if he is truly a good man.

95
00:08:39,818 --> 00:08:41,485
That makes sense.

96
00:08:41,485 --> 00:08:45,718
However, to see Shao Ji Zu for who he is,

97
00:08:45,718 --> 00:08:49,052
you don't need to go out of your way
to wander the world.

98
00:08:49,052 --> 00:08:51,118
I saw through him long ago.

99
00:08:51,118 --> 00:08:56,205
That man has an unspeakable hypocrisy,
and he's arrogant.

100
00:08:56,205 --> 00:09:01,018
He always says our young mistress is highly
skilled in martial arts and a natural prodigy.

101
00:09:01,018 --> 00:09:03,885
He even says,
"Given time, she will definitely defeat him."

102
00:09:03,885 --> 00:09:06,645
Setting aside whether he's sincere,

103
00:09:06,645 --> 00:09:10,421
just that phrase, "she will surely defeat him",
isn't that arrogant?

104
00:09:10,421 --> 00:09:12,261
Why use him as the standard?

105
00:09:12,261 --> 00:09:14,651
He's no great master.

106
00:09:14,651 --> 00:09:17,285
Your young mistress is quite good
at judging people.

107
00:09:17,285 --> 00:09:19,441
Of course.

108
00:09:22,541 --> 00:09:26,818
It's just a pity that she has never
actually defeated Shao Ji Zu even once.

109
00:09:26,818 --> 00:09:28,352
It's so frustrating.

110
00:09:28,352 --> 00:09:30,952
Martial arts is about perception.

111
00:09:30,952 --> 00:09:34,241
No one knows where a person's limit is.

112
00:09:37,885 --> 00:09:41,418
I didn't expect
that while being hunted by soldiers

113
00:09:41,418 --> 00:09:44,718
and carrying a child
who could bring trouble at any moment,

114
00:09:44,718 --> 00:09:46,418
you could still be this happy.

115
00:09:46,418 --> 00:09:48,485
I've only been out for a few days,

116
00:09:48,485 --> 00:09:52,495
but I've fought with Shengyun Stronghold
and the Tang Sect.

117
00:09:54,552 --> 00:09:59,041
Perhaps there will be
even more adventures ahead.

118
00:10:00,391 --> 00:10:01,751
When we reach the capital,

119
00:10:01,751 --> 00:10:03,981
I'll introduce you to a powerful backer,
Xiao Zhao.

120
00:10:03,981 --> 00:10:05,952
With him around, we have nothing to fear.

121
00:10:05,952 --> 00:10:09,018
Forget Shengyun Stronghold or Hanshui Palace.

122
00:10:09,018 --> 00:10:10,418
Even if the Heroes of the North
and South showed up,

123
00:10:10,418 --> 00:10:12,418
I wouldn't be afraid.

124
00:10:12,418 --> 00:10:14,052
Surnamed Zhao,

125
00:10:14,052 --> 00:10:15,885
and he's your backer.

126
00:10:15,885 --> 00:10:18,105
There's likely only one such person
in the capital.

127
00:10:18,105 --> 00:10:19,105
That's him.

128
00:10:19,105 --> 00:10:21,445
The Master of Nanqing Palace,
cousin to the current Emperor.

129
00:10:21,445 --> 00:10:22,925
Zhao Zhuo Qing.

130
00:10:23,918 --> 00:10:26,518
Huo, you are a friend of Prince Hui?

131
00:10:26,518 --> 00:10:28,605
You know him?

132
00:10:28,605 --> 00:10:32,052
Then do you also know
the young servant by his side, Zhao Zhi Er?

133
00:10:32,052 --> 00:10:36,518
The one who's known as The Terror of the Gods?

134
00:10:36,518 --> 00:10:38,518
Compared to The Terror of the Gods,

135
00:10:38,518 --> 00:10:42,352
I'm actually more familiar
with the one called The Ghost's Sorrow.

136
00:10:42,352 --> 00:10:46,125
Lord Zhan's servant, Ming Zhu Er?

137
00:10:46,125 --> 00:10:48,218
I heard that the two of them
are a pair of mischievous monkeys.

138
00:10:48,218 --> 00:10:52,118
The children in the capital have even turned
their exploits into nursery rhymes.

139
00:10:52,118 --> 00:10:53,718
Were you also teased by them?

140
00:10:53,718 --> 00:10:55,552
Not teased, exactly.

141
00:10:55,552 --> 00:11:00,655
But they certainly caused me
a great deal of trouble.

142
00:11:02,718 --> 00:11:05,085
You've been fishing for info from me,

143
00:11:05,085 --> 00:11:08,291
but now I've finally spotted your slip-up.

144
00:11:09,345 --> 00:11:12,205
You must be someone from the court.

145
00:11:12,205 --> 00:11:15,785
Otherwise,
you wouldn't know so many inside details.

146
00:11:15,785 --> 00:11:18,218
Are you sure the person you met
was his accomplice?

147
00:11:18,218 --> 00:11:20,755
Most likely.
The man had excellent lightness skills.

148
00:11:20,755 --> 00:11:22,985
He led me in circles through
the woods for quite a long time.

149
00:11:22,985 --> 00:11:26,318
After that,
I completely lost track of his trail.

150
00:11:26,318 --> 00:11:27,552
Strange.

151
00:11:27,552 --> 00:11:30,775
I've never heard of him
having an accomplice before.

152
00:11:34,685 --> 00:11:37,025
[Yan Ziqing, Yunying Sect]
[Mo Dao, Master of The Xiuluo Cult]

153
00:11:37,025 --> 00:11:41,425
There are too many fallen leaves at this time.

154
00:11:50,745 --> 00:11:54,065
It's Hanshui Palace's Dragon-Slaying Coil.

155
00:11:54,065 --> 00:11:56,852
The one fighting here shouldn't be him.

156
00:11:56,852 --> 00:11:58,818
He was hit
by your Old Souls at First Glance poison.

157
00:11:58,818 --> 00:12:01,885
So he wouldn't be foolish enough
to cross Hanshui Palace again.

158
00:12:01,885 --> 00:12:05,485
No. It must be him.

159
00:12:05,485 --> 00:12:10,885
In this world, how many people are there
who can withstand the Dragon-Slaying Coil?

160
00:12:10,885 --> 00:12:13,952
We must capture him before Shao Ji Zu does.

161
00:12:13,952 --> 00:12:18,845
Such a massive achievement
cannot be allowed to slip away.

162
00:12:20,555 --> 00:12:22,165
He is so severely injured,

163
00:12:22,165 --> 00:12:25,005
yet he took a direct hit from the Sun Envoy.

164
00:12:25,005 --> 00:12:29,085
The two of us are no match for him.

165
00:12:30,085 --> 00:12:33,618
Do you know why your Yunying Sect
can never achieve greatness?

166
00:12:33,618 --> 00:12:35,285
Too many damn rules.

167
00:12:35,285 --> 00:12:38,151
Who says capturing someone
requires a head-on confrontation? Stupid.

168
00:12:38,151 --> 00:12:41,952
Our Xiuluo Cult roam the world
relying on more than just martial arts.

169
00:12:41,952 --> 00:12:43,805
If we want to catch him,

170
00:12:43,805 --> 00:12:46,018
there are plenty of ways.

171
00:12:46,018 --> 00:12:48,251
What? Giving up the search?

172
00:12:48,251 --> 00:12:49,418
Search for what?

173
00:12:49,418 --> 00:12:50,818
If he wants to leave Xiangzhou,

174
00:12:50,818 --> 00:12:52,285
he must travel by water.

175
00:12:52,285 --> 00:12:54,085
Then we'll wait for him at the ferry.

176
00:12:54,085 --> 00:12:56,718
Waiting at our ease for a weary enemy
is much easier than

177
00:12:56,718 --> 00:12:59,585
exhausting ourselves chasing him
through these mountains, right?

178
00:13:21,218 --> 00:13:24,504
I wonder who could be so cruel.

179
00:13:26,085 --> 00:13:27,885
Huo.

180
00:13:27,885 --> 00:13:30,518
This child must be from the Hanshui Palace.

181
00:13:31,425 --> 00:13:33,018
When you lured Yan Zi Qing away,

182
00:13:33,018 --> 00:13:37,352
the Sun Envoy mentioned he hadn't had
his medicine for days.

183
00:13:37,352 --> 00:13:40,635
It seems he's been fed poison since childhood.

184
00:13:40,635 --> 00:13:43,005
Fed poison since childhood?

185
00:13:46,085 --> 00:13:49,325
He's been fed poison since childhood,
yet he's perfectly fine now.

186
00:13:50,118 --> 00:13:52,301
Do you mean

187
00:13:52,301 --> 00:13:55,125
he's like those from the Xiuluo Cult
or the Tang Sect,

188
00:13:55,125 --> 00:13:57,525
taking poison to train?

189
00:13:57,525 --> 00:13:59,445
But looking at his meridians,

190
00:13:59,445 --> 00:14:01,101
he doesn't look like a martial artist.

191
00:14:01,101 --> 00:14:03,251
Do you remember Ge Yun Fei?

192
00:14:03,251 --> 00:14:04,965
He didn't want to kill the boy.

193
00:14:04,965 --> 00:14:07,018
He wanted to use him to save a life.

194
00:14:07,018 --> 00:14:08,485
To save a life?

195
00:14:08,485 --> 00:14:14,245
You must have heard of the secret treasure
of Hanshui Palace, the Chang Hong Bi.

196
00:14:14,245 --> 00:14:17,405
The century-old Hanshui Palace
possesses the rare Chang Hong Bi,

197
00:14:17,405 --> 00:14:19,285
[Chang Hong Bi, Hanshui Palace]
nurtured with Azure Tri-Life Water.

198
00:14:19,285 --> 00:14:22,651
The value of this treasure is its ability
to cure all poisons.

199
00:14:22,651 --> 00:14:25,085
The treasure that Shengyun Stronghold
and the Tang Sect are fighting for

200
00:14:25,085 --> 00:14:29,085
is not an object, but this child.

201
00:14:29,085 --> 00:14:30,685
The Chang Hong Bi is not a piece of jade.

202
00:14:30,685 --> 00:14:32,885
It is a person?

203
00:14:32,885 --> 00:14:35,885
This child has so many scars on their hands.

204
00:14:35,885 --> 00:14:38,615
I'm afraid that's where they came from.

205
00:14:42,285 --> 00:14:43,541
No wonder.

206
00:14:43,541 --> 00:14:47,018
He always carries a faint scent of medicine.

207
00:14:47,018 --> 00:14:51,352
The green poison that the two envoys
of Hanshui Palace forced him to drink,

208
00:14:51,352 --> 00:14:53,952
I'm afraid it was Azure Tri-Life Water.

209
00:14:53,952 --> 00:14:55,418
Due to his unique constitution,

210
00:14:55,418 --> 00:14:57,518
he can drink it for years and survive.

211
00:14:57,518 --> 00:15:00,651
Though he survives,

212
00:15:00,651 --> 00:15:04,952
he still has to endure the immense pain
of the poison.

213
00:15:04,952 --> 00:15:07,975
Perhaps to Granny Hanshui,

214
00:15:09,151 --> 00:15:12,565
he is just an object kept by Hanshui Palace.

215
00:15:13,352 --> 00:15:17,818
But the legend of the Chang Hong Bi
has existed for over a hundred years.

216
00:15:17,818 --> 00:15:20,725
Could this child already be
a hundred years old?

217
00:15:20,725 --> 00:15:26,485
Don't the eldest daughters of Linglong Manor
all take the same name, Huo Ling Long?

218
00:15:26,485 --> 00:15:27,885
Over this past century,

219
00:15:27,885 --> 00:15:31,318
the Chang Hong Bi
may not always be the same person.

220
00:15:31,318 --> 00:15:35,151
So the claim that the Chang Hong Bi
is a jade is just a rumor

221
00:15:35,151 --> 00:15:38,818
spread by the Hanshui Palace
to mislead everyone.

222
00:15:38,818 --> 00:15:42,425
No wonder he eyes everyone
with such a weird look.

223
00:15:42,425 --> 00:15:45,651
Wandering the world at such a young age,

224
00:15:45,651 --> 00:15:48,885
with everyone coveting his special ability,

225
00:15:48,885 --> 00:15:53,441
it's no surprise that he doesn't trust anyone.

226
00:15:57,208 --> 00:16:01,565
I suspect he is more calculating
than you think.

227
00:16:01,565 --> 00:16:03,885
In the fight between Shengyun Stronghold
and the Tang Sect,

228
00:16:03,885 --> 00:16:08,318
that yellow dog pouncing out
suddenly must have been his doing.

229
00:16:08,318 --> 00:16:09,818
Do you remember?

230
00:16:09,818 --> 00:16:14,645
The dog was overly affectionate toward him
the first time they met.

231
00:16:14,645 --> 00:16:18,485
Are you saying he knows Mind Control?

232
00:16:18,485 --> 00:16:21,301
This skill must be practiced from childhood.

233
00:16:21,301 --> 00:16:22,485
Upon reaching a certain age,

234
00:16:22,485 --> 00:16:24,085
it must be aided by inner power.

235
00:16:24,085 --> 00:16:26,085
He has no inner power,

236
00:16:26,085 --> 00:16:29,052
so the Mind Control is beyond his reach.

237
00:16:29,052 --> 00:16:30,765
But to deal with a dog,

238
00:16:30,765 --> 00:16:33,045
it is more than enough.

239
00:16:33,045 --> 00:16:35,685
He was betting
that you would step in to save the dog,

240
00:16:35,685 --> 00:16:38,908
thereby changing the course of the battle.

241
00:16:40,485 --> 00:16:44,161
Do you still intend to continue protecting him?

242
00:16:51,358 --> 00:16:53,425
If our guesses are correct,

243
00:16:53,425 --> 00:16:56,405
he grew up in Hanshui Palace,

244
00:16:56,405 --> 00:16:59,885
forced to swallow poison every day
at the mercy of others,

245
00:16:59,885 --> 00:17:02,618
enduring endless agony.

246
00:17:02,618 --> 00:17:05,318
No one has ever treated him like a human being.

247
00:17:05,318 --> 00:17:08,518
So how could he know what compassion is?

248
00:17:08,518 --> 00:17:11,752
How could he distinguish
between right and wrong?

249
00:17:11,752 --> 00:17:14,108
He just wants to survive.

250
00:17:15,252 --> 00:17:18,618
You are truly broad-minded and kind-hearted.

251
00:17:19,518 --> 00:17:21,151
But in the martial arts world,

252
00:17:21,151 --> 00:17:22,885
with a personality like yours,

253
00:17:22,885 --> 00:17:24,445
I'm afraid you'll be taken advantage of.

254
00:17:24,445 --> 00:17:26,048
The world may be dangerous,

255
00:17:26,048 --> 00:17:28,721
but there are good people like you too.

256
00:17:30,045 --> 00:17:34,352
In my opinion,
why don't we just travel together?

257
00:17:34,352 --> 00:17:36,718
Traveling with me is not a good idea.

258
00:17:36,718 --> 00:17:38,072
Also--

259
00:17:38,725 --> 00:17:40,791
Didn't you just take Linglong Honey?

260
00:17:40,791 --> 00:17:42,837
How come it hurts again?

261
00:17:44,085 --> 00:17:46,708
How badly are you injured?

262
00:18:03,018 --> 00:18:04,798
Bear with it.

263
00:18:10,518 --> 00:18:11,765
You were hit by a Love Longing.

264
00:18:11,765 --> 00:18:13,085
A small fragment was left inside.

265
00:18:13,085 --> 00:18:14,885
I've taken it out for you.

266
00:18:14,885 --> 00:18:17,108
Thank you, Huo.

267
00:18:22,252 --> 00:18:24,252
Who exactly are you?

268
00:18:24,252 --> 00:18:26,618
It wasn't a coincidence
that you appeared at the inn.

269
00:18:26,618 --> 00:18:29,285
You've been poisoned by
the Old Souls at First Glance.

270
00:18:29,285 --> 00:18:31,718
You want the boy's blood to save your life.

271
00:18:31,718 --> 00:18:33,568
You recognize Old Souls at First Glance?

272
00:18:33,568 --> 00:18:35,518
I'm an old friend of the Tang Sect's heir.

273
00:18:35,518 --> 00:18:38,618
He's obsessed with toxicology.
I've seen his notes.

274
00:18:38,618 --> 00:18:40,485
This poison is usually fatal upon contact.

275
00:18:40,485 --> 00:18:42,085
But after being poisoned,

276
00:18:42,085 --> 00:18:45,352
you used inner breath to reverse Iron Shackles
to seal the opposing acupoints.

277
00:18:45,352 --> 00:18:48,485
Every time you reverse it,
you can survive for one more day.

278
00:18:48,485 --> 00:18:51,285
But a new mark appears on your back.

279
00:18:51,285 --> 00:18:53,618
Iron Shackles can only contain
the spread of the poison.

280
00:18:53,618 --> 00:18:55,518
But every time you force
the reversal of inner breath,

281
00:18:55,518 --> 00:18:58,518
the poison seeps deeper into you.

282
00:18:58,518 --> 00:19:02,681
Whenever the poison flares up,
the pain becomes unbearable.

283
00:19:05,085 --> 00:19:08,318
Right now, I cannot explain much.

284
00:19:08,318 --> 00:19:09,552
But I am not a bad person.

285
00:19:09,552 --> 00:19:11,718
You're not a bad person?

286
00:19:11,718 --> 00:19:13,418
Fine.

287
00:19:13,418 --> 00:19:18,318
So how do you explain the Great Compassion Palm
mark of the Shangqing Sect on your back?

288
00:19:18,318 --> 00:19:21,718
The Shangqing Sect is renowned
for being fair and prudent,

289
00:19:21,718 --> 00:19:23,018
never killing the innocent.

290
00:19:23,018 --> 00:19:25,052
Every time they strike,

291
00:19:25,052 --> 00:19:27,951
they only kill heinous scoundrels.

292
00:19:27,951 --> 00:19:29,885
Once struck by the Great Compassion Palm,

293
00:19:29,885 --> 00:19:31,651
your blood will boil,

294
00:19:31,651 --> 00:19:33,818
and the intense heat will cause
dark red spots to appear.

295
00:19:33,818 --> 00:19:35,418
Scalding to the touch.

296
00:19:35,418 --> 00:19:39,552
The Shangqing Sect and the Xiuluo Cult
both good and evil want you dead.

297
00:19:39,552 --> 00:19:42,241
Just who are you?

298
00:19:44,518 --> 00:19:46,748
Don't be afraid. I'm here.

299
00:19:50,018 --> 00:19:51,618
I'll ask you one last time.

300
00:19:51,618 --> 00:19:53,748
Are you going to tell me or not?

301
00:19:57,618 --> 00:20:00,352
If you've decided I'm a villain,

302
00:20:01,352 --> 00:20:03,052
then let us...

303
00:20:04,052 --> 00:20:05,985
part ways right here.

304
00:20:20,451 --> 00:20:22,068
Let's go.

305
00:22:33,965 --> 00:22:37,205
<i>You must be Constable Liu's friend
from the capital.</i>

306
00:22:37,852 --> 00:22:40,425
<i>How did you know I came from the capital?</i>

307
00:22:41,685 --> 00:22:43,052
[Clerk Fang, Yicheng County]
<i>Well...</i>

308
00:22:43,052 --> 00:22:44,885
<i>I heard from Constable Liu.</i>

309
00:22:44,885 --> 00:22:47,885
<i>He had a sworn brother working in the capital.</i>

310
00:22:47,885 --> 00:22:51,055
<i>I figured it might be you.</i>

311
00:23:04,285 --> 00:23:06,308
<i>I'm sorry, I'm too late.</i>

312
00:23:08,018 --> 00:23:10,018
<i>How did Liu die?</i>

313
00:23:12,928 --> 00:23:16,005
<i>He was out on duty a few days ago.</i>

314
00:23:16,005 --> 00:23:20,121
<i>Unfortunately,
he slipped into the river and drowned.</i>

315
00:25:28,718 --> 00:25:30,938
<i>The Great Compassion Palm.</i>

316
00:25:40,052 --> 00:25:42,651
[Zhi Hua, Black Fox]
<i>The item is indeed here.</i>

317
00:25:42,651 --> 00:25:44,318
<i>Useless fools.</i>

318
00:25:44,318 --> 00:25:47,241
<i>They searched so long and found nothing.</i>

319
00:25:50,352 --> 00:25:52,018
<i>Hand it over.</i>

320
00:26:02,918 --> 00:26:04,751
<i>Trying to hide?</i>

321
00:26:05,818 --> 00:26:07,751
<i>I dare you to hide!</i>

322
00:26:23,285 --> 00:26:25,118
<i>Speak! Where is Liu Hong Yi?</i>

323
00:26:25,118 --> 00:26:27,718
<i>He's at the county office!
At the county office!</i>

324
00:26:32,651 --> 00:26:35,552
[Uphold Virtue, Punish Evil]
<i>There is no need to worry.</i>

325
00:26:35,552 --> 00:26:39,818
<i>Our master's subordinate, He Bo,
has already made his move.</i>

326
00:26:40,818 --> 00:26:42,852
<i>In this territory of Xiangzhou,</i>

327
00:26:42,852 --> 00:26:44,752
<i>is there anything he can't handle?</i>

328
00:26:44,752 --> 00:26:46,085
<i>You have no idea.</i>

329
00:26:46,085 --> 00:26:50,288
<i>Liu Hong Yi is well-known
for being stubborn and difficult.</i>

330
00:26:50,288 --> 00:26:53,052
<i>At the county office,
he doesn't even respect me.</i>

331
00:26:53,052 --> 00:26:56,118
<i>Talking back to me is just routine for him.</i>

332
00:26:56,118 --> 00:26:57,418
<i>Do you really think</i>

333
00:26:57,418 --> 00:27:01,318
[County Magistrate Li, Yicheng County]
<i>we can get any information out of that man?</i>

334
00:27:01,318 --> 00:27:05,451
<i>Whether he talks or not depends
on who interrogates him.</i>

335
00:27:05,451 --> 00:27:10,052
<i>Do you know who is interrogating
Liu Hong Yi right now?</i>

336
00:27:10,052 --> 00:27:11,918
<i>Who?</i>

337
00:27:11,918 --> 00:27:17,918
<i>Someone who will make him wish he were dead.</i>

338
00:27:27,405 --> 00:27:30,225
[Liu Hong Yi, Constable of Yicheng County]

339
00:27:50,118 --> 00:27:52,151
<i>The item... Did you get it?</i>

340
00:27:52,151 --> 00:27:53,451
<i>Don't worry.</i>

341
00:28:03,245 --> 00:28:04,605
[Liu Yan, Five Venoms of Xiuluo Cult]

342
00:28:04,605 --> 00:28:06,068
[Gui Mu, Five Venoms of Xiuluo Cult]

343
00:28:07,805 --> 00:28:10,425
[Mei Ying, Five Venoms of Xiuluo Cult]
[Han Feng, Five Venoms of Xiuluo Cult]

344
00:28:15,218 --> 00:28:17,451
<i>Once my Old Souls at First Glance hits you,</i>

345
00:28:17,451 --> 00:28:19,951
<i>you won't leave here alive.</i>

346
00:28:20,752 --> 00:28:23,151
<i>You won't make it out with me.</i>

347
00:28:23,151 --> 00:28:24,218
<i>Just leave.</i>

348
00:28:25,018 --> 00:28:27,165
<i>Take that and hurry off now!</i>

349
00:28:28,718 --> 00:28:30,585
<i>I'm not going without you.</i>

350
00:30:58,052 --> 00:31:00,485
<i>He was hit by my Old Souls at First Glance,</i>

351
00:31:00,485 --> 00:31:02,718
<i>and your Great Compassion Palm.</i>

352
00:31:02,718 --> 00:31:05,005
<i>He won't last long.</i>

353
00:31:33,685 --> 00:31:36,465
<i>You must deliver this...</i>

354
00:31:38,252 --> 00:31:40,505
<i>to the capital.</i>

355
00:32:17,885 --> 00:32:21,418
A-A-Are we just leaving him?

356
00:32:22,418 --> 00:32:24,485
So you can talk?

357
00:32:24,485 --> 00:32:26,485
Have you been pretending to be mute?

358
00:32:26,485 --> 00:32:31,451
N-N-No, I'm not.

359
00:32:37,418 --> 00:32:40,451
Are you the Chang Hong Bi of Hanshui Palace?

360
00:32:40,451 --> 00:32:46,451
M-My name isn't Chang Hong Bi.

361
00:32:48,118 --> 00:32:50,165
So you could always talk.

362
00:32:53,052 --> 00:32:58,718
But... after drinking that... poison,

363
00:32:58,718 --> 00:33:04,085
I lost my voice.

364
00:33:04,085 --> 00:33:07,818
Just now... my throat felt itchy...

365
00:33:07,818 --> 00:33:12,118
and my body... was burning up.

366
00:33:12,118 --> 00:33:16,418
So... I cried out.

367
00:33:16,418 --> 00:33:18,451
So, if you don't drink that medicine,

368
00:33:18,451 --> 00:33:20,965
you can speak just like a normal person.

369
00:33:30,285 --> 00:33:31,885
You're free now.

370
00:33:31,885 --> 00:33:34,652
Is there anywhere you want to go?
I can take you there.

371
00:33:35,718 --> 00:33:39,618
We'd better find a place
far away from these chaos.

372
00:33:39,618 --> 00:33:42,045
I'll keep your identity a secret.

373
00:33:45,085 --> 00:33:47,018
You have nowhere to go?

374
00:33:47,018 --> 00:33:52,945
I-I-I only trust you.

375
00:33:58,918 --> 00:34:00,625
Let's go.

376
00:34:04,252 --> 00:34:07,905
He's... badly injured.

377
00:34:10,852 --> 00:34:12,845
So you're worried about him?

378
00:34:15,852 --> 00:34:18,685
At the pavilion today,

379
00:34:18,685 --> 00:34:22,152
he told me... to run away.

380
00:34:23,318 --> 00:34:26,485
You mean that after he saved you
from the Hanshui Palace disciples,

381
00:34:26,485 --> 00:34:28,385
he didn't drink your blood?

382
00:35:33,885 --> 00:35:37,025
You must be the one who intervened at the inn.

383
00:35:37,718 --> 00:35:39,018
You're badly injured,

384
00:35:39,018 --> 00:35:41,218
yet you still meddle in others' business?

385
00:35:41,218 --> 00:35:43,025
30 years ago...

386
00:35:43,685 --> 00:35:47,852
the old master of Shengyun Stronghold
died at the hands of the Tang Sect.

387
00:35:47,852 --> 00:35:51,518
Since then, you have been sworn enemies.

388
00:35:52,085 --> 00:35:53,718
Your sect is skilled with swords,

389
00:35:53,718 --> 00:35:55,725
but the Tang Sect excels in poisons.

390
00:35:55,725 --> 00:35:57,885
You've clashed many times,

391
00:35:57,885 --> 00:36:00,652
but you never gained the upper hand.

392
00:36:01,652 --> 00:36:02,752
That's why...

393
00:36:03,752 --> 00:36:06,451
upon hearing of Hanshui Palace's treasure,

394
00:36:06,451 --> 00:36:09,565
you'd seize it at any cost.

395
00:36:11,485 --> 00:36:15,051
Your Shengyun Stronghold has lost two masters.

396
00:36:15,951 --> 00:36:19,185
Master Jiao, stop being so stubborn.

397
00:36:28,808 --> 00:36:30,485
Didn't you say I'm good at martial arts?

398
00:36:30,485 --> 00:36:31,821
Then I'll hold them off for a while.

399
00:36:31,821 --> 00:36:34,565
Let's see if your words are genuine.

400
00:36:35,565 --> 00:36:37,605
You got here fast, Master Jiao.

401
00:36:37,605 --> 00:36:40,051
So you're willing to risk
offending Linglong Manor

402
00:36:40,051 --> 00:36:44,951
and Hanshui Palace
just to seize the Chang Hong Bi.

403
00:36:44,951 --> 00:36:50,005
Indeed, I should show Hanshui Palace
some respect.

404
00:36:50,005 --> 00:36:51,818
But as for Linglong Manor,

405
00:36:51,818 --> 00:36:54,152
I don't care about them at all!

406
00:37:23,685 --> 00:37:24,918
The bronze sword?

407
00:37:24,918 --> 00:37:28,118
Yin Yang An can defeat all weapons.

408
00:37:28,118 --> 00:37:32,885
Because when it was forged,
lodestones were added.

409
00:37:32,885 --> 00:37:38,085
So, against bronze weapons,
it's just an ordinary sword.

410
00:37:38,085 --> 00:37:41,051
How did you know the secret of Yin Yang An?

411
00:37:41,051 --> 00:37:45,308
I know plenty more secrets
about your family's martial arts!

412
00:38:34,445 --> 00:38:36,125
Even if you lay down your life,

413
00:38:36,125 --> 00:38:37,718
you can't protect this child!

414
00:38:37,718 --> 00:38:40,051
After I'm done with him,

415
00:38:40,051 --> 00:38:42,218
I'll deal with you!

416
00:39:20,445 --> 00:39:23,227
Save him! Go save him!

417
00:39:42,918 --> 00:39:45,505
So you've even studied A Fleeting Glimpse?

418
00:39:47,018 --> 00:39:48,518
I'm the one they want.

419
00:39:48,518 --> 00:39:50,325
You two should go!

420
00:39:53,951 --> 00:39:56,045
I won't leave you behind.

421
00:40:00,925 --> 00:40:02,885
Today, I shall fight to the death,

422
00:40:02,885 --> 00:40:05,885
and never leave this scourge to Linglong Manor!

423
00:40:38,885 --> 00:40:41,618
What? Haven't you had enough?

424
00:40:41,618 --> 00:40:43,125
I'll tell you the truth.

425
00:40:43,125 --> 00:40:47,285
This sword formation was created
specifically for your family.

426
00:40:47,285 --> 00:40:49,265
You can't break it.

427
00:40:50,352 --> 00:40:52,352
What are you waiting for?

428
00:40:52,352 --> 00:40:54,405
Go save him!

429
00:41:56,165 --> 00:42:00,652
Who told you about the secret
of Yin Yang An and A Fleeting Glimpse?

430
00:42:00,652 --> 00:42:03,018
And where did you get this sword formation?

431
00:42:03,018 --> 00:42:05,218
We have no grudge against Shengyun Stronghold.

432
00:42:05,218 --> 00:42:07,652
Why did you go to such lengths to target us?

433
00:42:08,951 --> 00:42:12,965
If you want to know, go ask Huo Tian Xing.

434
00:42:12,965 --> 00:42:17,718
However, if you let me go today,
I will not be grateful!

435
00:42:17,718 --> 00:42:21,418
You will surely regret it one day!

436
00:42:21,418 --> 00:42:24,318
The sword formation you spent years on
was broken by me in an instant.

437
00:42:24,318 --> 00:42:25,805
What else do I have to fear?

438
00:42:26,918 --> 00:42:28,918
Even if you go study ten more formations,

439
00:42:28,918 --> 00:42:30,625
you're still no threat to me.

440
00:42:34,885 --> 00:42:36,205
Wait a moment.

441
00:42:37,065 --> 00:42:38,507
What?

442
00:42:38,507 --> 00:42:40,424
Regretting it already?

443
00:42:41,018 --> 00:42:42,618
Have your disciples double up.

444
00:42:42,618 --> 00:42:44,465
Leave two horses for us.

